      "content": "It sounds like you might be experiencing a severe allergic reaction, potentially anaphylaxis, given the symptoms you've described, especially the throat tightness which suggests swelling. It's important not to take Benadryl if you suspect a true allergic reaction, as it can worsen some symptoms. Seek immediate medical attention at the nearest emergency room or call emergency services right away. Avoiding further reactions may involve avoiding similar foods until you can speak with a healthcare provider.",
