      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait why wouldnt benadryl help? i have some in my cabinet right now. the throat thing is just a little uncomfortable, not like i cant breathe or anything. if i just take a double dose of diphenhydramine i can probably just ride it out and sleep it off, right? it seems like a lot of effort to drive to the er for just some hives.",
